/dist/
# Every binary this module builds, not just the main one. `go build ./tools/x`
# writes ./x into the working directory, and a 3 MB binary was committed that way
# — carrying the build machine's home directory, which is one of the shapes
# tools/audithistory exists to refuse.
/reviewer
/audithistory
/checkadrs
/checklicenses
/workspace
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
# The plugin compiled. Rebuilt by `npm run build`, and by `make check`
# before the tests that need it, so a tracked copy is only ever a stale one.
plugins/typescript/dist/

# The review workspace's web application. Built by `make web`, which also
# copies it to where the service embeds it. The placeholder is tracked so the
# service compiles without it.
/web/dist/
/web/test-results/
/web/playwright-report/
/internal/workspace/web/dist/*
!/internal/workspace/web/dist/placeholder.txt

# Terraform's working files for deploy/gcp, one directory per project and
# service, and a configuration kept beside it: it names the operator's
# repositories, which do not belong in this history (ADR-0010).
/deploy/gcp/.terraform/
/deploy/gcp/*.tfstate
/deploy/gcp/*.tfstate.*
/deploy/gcp/*.tfvars
/deploy/gcp/workspace.config.yaml
